{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51362","headline":"白门前 · 李贺","name":"白门前","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白门前，大楼喜，悬虹云，挞龙尾。\n剑破匣，舞蛟龙，蚩尤死，鼓龙蓬。\n天堕地，无惊飞，海千里。\n（《四部业刊》影印所以刊本《李贺歌诗编》）（此诗爲《全唐诗》卷三九三李贺《上之回》一诗之别本，前八句仅数字不同，末四句，《上之回》爲七言二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}